The Bounded Dream Rehearsal implementation follows the algorithm described by
Nijjer et al. in arXiv:2607.19749 and the Apache-2.0 reference artifact at
https://github.com/gurpnijjer/dream-rehearsal, inspected at commit
7680778f798be3a27a17c320cc875b573c45f0e1. The reference source tree is not
vendored; implementation provenance and deviations are documented in
docs/protocols/bounded_dream_rehearsal_atari.md.

KARROW can load DINOv3 model weights distributed separately by Meta Platforms,
Inc. under the DINOv3 License. Those weights and DINOv3 source code are not
included in this repository. Their exact local artifact hashes are recorded in
each KARROW launch manifest.
